  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "dolma3.5_pool",
  "description": "\u26a0\ufe0f IMPORTANT NOTICE \u26a0\ufe0f\nThis is the Dolma 3.5 pool. It contains no quality upsampling or mixing. This is an updated version of the Dolma 3 pool with additional quality filtering and more data sources.\nIf you are interested in the data used to train Olmo 3 7B and Olmo 3 32B, visit allenai/dolma3_mix-6T-1025. \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDolma 3.5 Pool\n\t\n\nThe Dolma 3.5 pool is a dataset of nearly 10 trillion tokens from a diverse mix of web content, academic publications, code, and more. For detailed\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/dolma3.5_pool.",
